<h2 id="what">What this site is, and is not</h2>
<p>
  The site republishes the fish stocking schedules, plans and reports that
  state wildlife agencies publish: the California Department of Fish and
  Wildlife (CDFW) for California, and each other state's own agency, named on
  that state's pages. It is not a government site. It is not affiliated with
  or endorsed by CDFW or any other agency.
</p>
<p>
  It is not a source of fishing regulations. Before you fish, check the
  current regulations, license rules, closures and posted signs from the
  agency that manages the water.
</p>

<h2 id="data">The data can be wrong or late</h2>
<p>
  Agencies change, delay and cancel plantings, sometimes after they publish
  them, and their records can contain mistakes. This site copies their pages
  on a schedule, so it can be behind them, and the copying can add errors of
  its own. A listed planting is not a promise that fish will be there. For
  anything that matters to you, check the agency's own page; the
  <a href="{{ root }}about/">about page</a> links to each source.
</p>

